      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2>From field events to filed report.</h2>
      <p>Four capabilities carry every filing, in every sector, from raw field data to a submission you can stand behind.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="capability">
      <div>
        <p class="card-kicker">01 — Mapping</p>
        <h3>Requirement mapping</h3>
        <p>Every asset, inspection, and form is tied to the specific regulation it satisfies — a permit condition, an inspection interval, a service instruction — down to the citation. Not a checkbox labeled "compliant."</p>
      </div>
      <div class="capability-media">
        <img src="/static/img/compliance/requirement-mapping.webp" width="512" height="256" alt="Requirements for Skid A-114, mapped: 3 active requirements. Quarterly LDAR next due Oct 15, SPCC inspection current, Title V monitoring continuous and on track." loading="lazy">
