        <p class="card-kicker">02 — Register</p>
        <h3>Obligation &amp; permit register</h3>
        <p>Every permit, license, and recurring obligation in one register: what it covers, which assets it applies to, when it renews, what conditions attach, and who owns it. Expirations and reporting deadlines surface before they're a problem.</p>
      </div>
