<section class="section">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Electronic reporting</p>
      <h2>Delivered the way the regulator wants it.</h2>
      <p>Every agency has its own portal, its own schema, its own idea of a "complete" submission — EPA's eGGRT for greenhouse gas reporting, a state's own emission inventory system, FERC's eTariff system, an agency-specific data feed for defense reporting. Assetas maps your data to each report: the same underlying record gets delivered as the formatted report, spreadsheet, or machine-readable file the destination actually requires.</p>
      <p>That includes structured formats built to each agency's published schema — not just PDFs meant for a human reviewer.</p>
